=== Matchday summary ===

[[Zong national football team|Zong]] produced the day's biggest surprise by defeating [[Balisca national football team|Balisca]] away from home. [[Volisania national football team|Volisania]] were the sharpest side on the opening day, while [[Hersatia national football team|Hersatia]] snatched a stoppage-time winner against [[Ayorin national football team|Ayorin]]. [[Galwa national football team|Galwa]] edged [[Sanrobonia national football team|Sanrobonia]] in a lively contest, [[Okaiken national football team|Okaiken]] recovered from an equaliser to beat [[Bayan national football team|Bayan]], and [[Balboa national football team|Balboa]] and [[Tondano national football team|Tondano]] shared the first goalless draw of the tournament.

